WEBVTT

00:13:26.739 --> 00:13:31.347
But not to replace the lost function, no --

00:13:31.347 --> 00:13:34.538
to help the brain help itself.

00:13:34.538 --> 00:13:37.178
And I hope this enticed your imagination,

00:13:37.178 --> 00:13:39.074
because I can promise to you

00:13:39.074 --> 00:13:42.317
this is not a matter of whether this revolution will occur,

00:13:42.317 --> 00:13:44.109
but when.

00:13:44.109 --> 00:13:46.342
And remember, we are only as great

00:13:46.357 --> 00:13:49.942
as our imagination, as big as our dream.

00:13:49.942 --> 00:13:51.934
Thank you.

00:13:51.934 --> 00:13:55.934
(Applause)